refsect1.para:
The term unit refers to each vera-started process (or a collection of processes). Each unit has a unit name, or label, that's used in vera/vlad commands to refer to it. The start and stop commands start and stop individual units. Units that do not get started automatically (see
vera.runlevels 8
) get started on demand by the start command, and stop shuts down the unit, irrespective of whether it was started automatically or manually.
